ypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^k\">\\(\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v\">\\(\\mathsf v\\)</span> 是项变量集的另一记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 在扩张语言中的额外构造子由相应定义继续作结构递归。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{var}_S(t)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\{x\\} &amp; t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\\n\\emptyset &amp; t=c_j,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{m=1}^{r_k}\\mathrm{var}_S(t_m) &amp; t=f_k(t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k}).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{var}_S(t)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\{x\\} &amp; t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\\n\\emptyset &amp; t=c_j,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{m=1}^{r_k}\\mathrm{var}_S(t_m) &amp; t=f_k(t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k}).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\varnothing &amp; \\varphi\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}_S(t_2) &amp; \\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{m=1}^{a_i}\\mathrm{var}_S(t_m) &amp; \\varphi=R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi) &amp; \\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\chi) &amp; \\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\} &amp; \\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi\\ \\lor\\ \\varphi=\\exists x\\,\\psi.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{FV}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\varnothing &amp; \\varphi\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{var}_S(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}_S(t_2) &amp; \\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{m=1}^{a_i}\\mathrm{var}_S(t_m) &amp; \\varphi=R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi) &amp; \\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\chi) &amp; \\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\} &amp; \\va